    "body": "> Can you file a separate Chromium issue for the issue you are having and include information about the platform? Once the `Promise` returned by `releaseInterface()` resolves another context should be able to claim it.\r\n\r\nSorry, i didn't make it clear.\r\nWe have 2 problems.\r\n1. unable to claim interface\r\n2. cannot identify which line number of the code raise the \"unable to claim interface\"\r\n\r\nQuestion 2 is chrome bug, i will file it in another place.\r\nBut the question 1 is strange. Because we checked all of our codes. All calls of `releaseInterface` is awaited. So we're out of clue\r\n",
